# L §7.1: "A rule can't test m >= 2028-01 on a time key, nor read rate[2025]: a law that starts on a date is a
# version with governs (LOAD-LITERAL)."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

input rate[y in years]: num

def x: num at reader
  rule base = rate[2026]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LITERAL ...
